msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/12-iot_Bluetooth_RGB_controller.rst:26
msgid "One message carries three numbers: how much red, how much green, how much blue. Send ``R255G128B0`` and the LED turns orange."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/12-iot_Bluetooth_RGB_controller.rst:29
msgid "This is the first **structured** message in the Bluetooth part - the sketch has to split it into three parts before it can use it, a small job you will meet everywhere."
msgstr ""

